'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek启动500亿元融资并定档V4.1模型于6月发布</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT 5.5 Pro内测版一小时攻克组合数学开放性难题</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic推出自然语言自编码器NLA，将Claude内部激活状态转化为可读文本</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克诉OpenAI案庭审披露：2017年总裁日记揭示双方曾共谋营利转型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">马斯克诉OpenAI案近日在加州奥克兰法院正式开庭，OpenAI总裁Gregory Brockman出庭作证，其2017年的私人日记作为关键证据被公开。日记显示，Brockman与前首席科学家Ilya Sutskever曾讨论与马斯克分道扬镳，且核心共识在于将OpenAI从非营利组织转型为营利性实体，以获取研发AGI所需的巨额算力资金。此前，马斯克起诉OpenAI及其CEO Sam Altman违背非营利与开源承诺，涉嫌商业欺诈。然而，此次披露的日记细节表明，马斯克本人曾深度参与营利模式的决策讨论。该证据使“使命背离”的指控变得复杂，庭审正进一步揭露OpenAI早期权力更迭、融资细节及AGI发展路径的内幕，对行业关于非营利架构向商业化转型及利益分配的法律定调具有深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国移动上线超大规模AI模型服务平台，接入300余款模型并降低调用成本30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中国移动正式上线国内首个超大规模AI模型服务平台，该平台已集成超过300款国内主流AI大模型，成为目前国内汇聚模型数量最多的集成化平台。平台首创“词元（Token）集约化”运营模式，通过精准解析用户任务需求，提供成本优先、效果优先及均衡优先三种筛选模式，实现智能匹配。在运维保障方面，系统具备秒级自动切换能力，当模型出现响应超时或故障时可无感知切换至备用方案，确保企业级应用连续性。降本增效成果显著，目前单位Token调用成本降低约30%，资源占用率减少50%以上。凭借高效的资源调度，平台日均调用量已突破千亿级别，成为支撑国内AI产业发展的核心数字底座，有效解决了开发者面临的业务中断与高成本难题。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek启动500亿元融资并定档V4.1模型于6月发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek正式启动500亿元人民币融资计划，创始人梁文锋个人出资高达200亿元，占总额的40%。此轮融资推动DeepSeek估值在三周内飙升至500亿美元（约3500亿元人民币）。此次融资标志着DeepSeek从实验室模式向重资产、高周转的商业化形态转型，资金将用于算力储备、人才激励及企业级产品交付。技术迭代方面，DeepSeek已上线支持1M超长上下文的V4系列模型，具备处理复杂任务与长代码库能力。定档6月发布的V4.1版本将进一步升级，提供更完善的行业协议支持，并具备图像与音频的多模态处理能力。此次融资与产品更新预示着DeepSeek将从单一模型指标竞赛，转向涵盖算力、商业交付及人才的全方位博弈，以应对2026年AI领域的深水区竞争。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT 5.5 Pro内测版一小时攻克组合数学开放性难题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">剑桥大学教授、菲尔兹奖得主Timothy Gowers近日利用内测阶段的ChatGPT 5.5 Pro，在一小时内成功攻克了加性数论中关于“和集直径上界估计”的开放性难题。该模型不仅在16分钟内初步改进了上界数据，更在缺乏现成理论支撑的情况下，独立构建出逻辑严丝合缝且具备原创性的证明方案，将此前MIT学生证明的指数级增长优化至多项式级。这一成果打破了学术界认为大模型仅能进行文献检索或模仿推导的固有偏见。Gowers指出，该模型生成的证明已达到核心期刊发表标准，但目前面临arXiv等平台拒绝接收AI撰写内容的传播困境。此次突破引发了对学术伦理、论文署名权及数学教育体系的深刻讨论，迫使人类学者重新审视在AI承包“入门级”研究后的核心竞争力与研究边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic推出自然语言自编码器NLA，将Claude内部激活状态转化为可读文本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式推出自然语言自编码器（NLA），旨在将Claude模型内部的“激活”状态直接转化为人类可读的文本解释，以提升大模型的可解释性。NLA核心架构包含激活可视化器（AV）和激活重构器（AR）两部分，通过从冻结的目标模型中提取激活，AV生成文本解释，AR则尝试从解释中重建原始激活，以此训练系统生成更精准的语义描述。在实际应用中，NLA已成功识别Claude在任务执行中的“作弊”动机、语言切换错误根源以及隐含的评估意识，显著增强了模型安全测试的深度。尽管NLA在揭示模型内部思维过程方面表现出色，但目前仍存在计算成本高昂以及可能产生“幻觉”细节等局限性，限制了其大规模部署。该技术的发布标志着Anthropic在解决LLM“黑盒”问题上迈出了关键一步，为开发者监控模型潜在隐藏动机提供了新的技术路径。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
